              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Iryo ni ryo tegeko ry'ifuhe, ku mugore ugitegekwa n'umugabo we agahindukirira undi, akaba yanduye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.5.29"
